# ==========================================
# Root Workspace Docker Ignore
# Exclude heavy binaries, traces, data, and logs across all subtrees
# ==========================================

# Dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**

# Version Control
.git
**/.git
.github
**/.github

# Build Artifacts
dist
**/dist
frontend/dist

# Runtime & Local Logs / Traces (CRITICAL: exclude in root AND all subdirs)
runs
**/runs
**/runs/**
screenshots
**/screenshots
**/screenshots/**
*.log
**/*.log
backend.log
**/backend.log
latest-trace.jsonl
**/*.jsonl

# Sensitive Environment Files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local Data, Resumes, and Non-Production Dirs
data
**/data
**/data/**
Data
**/Data
**/Data/**
resumes
**/resumes
**/resumes/**
docs
**/docs
**/docs/**
workday-auto-apply
**/workday-auto-apply
.ai
**/.ai
.claude
**/.claude
.gemini
**/.gemini
scratch
**/scratch
scratch_*

# Test Fixtures & Reports
tests/fixtures
**/tests/fixtures
reports
**/reports
